blue\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mpadded></mstyle><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhere <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"40\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is an integer.</p>\n</div></div>",
